    "text": "By Rebecca Caraway, Noozhawk Staff Writer ,\n1 days ago Santa Barbara residents are fighting to make sure a proposed housing development near the Mission won’t endanger their neighborhood. A recent petition regarding the eight-story, 270-unit housing project proposed for 505 E. Los Olivos St., behind the Santa Barbara Mission, has earned more than 5,400 signatures as of Tuesday. Read full article\n1",
